<p>zaqmi jo ran me fatima ka gulbadan huwa<br />
aur purze purze tan me libaas-e kohan huwa<br />
ghash pusht-e- zuljanaah pa shaah-e zaman huwa<br />
dast-e alam se chaak nabi ka kafan huwa</p>

<p>zaqmo'n ke mu se qoon ke darya ubal pade<br />
sar nange qabr se shah-e mardaa'n nikal pade<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mazloom kehta jaata tha mai be gunaah hoo'n<br />
maaro na mujh ko sibt-e risaalat panaah hoo'n<br />
tum logo'n ka quda ki qasam qair qaah hoo'n<br />
is qoul par quda ko mai rakhta gawaah hoo'n</p>

<p>kuch raham aata tha na kisi naabekaar ko<br />
shamsheere'n maarte the ghareebud dayaar ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nezaa laga jo seene pa tharra ke reh gaye<br />
baitha jo teer maathe pa tyoraa ke reh gaye<br />
girne lage to haatho'n ko latkaake reh gaye<br />
shukr-e quda zubaan se farmaake reh gaye</p>

<p>akbar na the jiluh me na abbas paas the<br />
mazloom beech me tha adu aas paas the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>seene pa bhala rakh ke giraaya hussain ko<br />
ji bhar ke zaalimo'n ne sataaya hussain ko<br />
girne pa qaak toda banaya hussain ko<br />
hai zulm ki ye had ke ghash aaya hussain ko</p>

<p>par dekhiyo hawaas shahinshaah-e nek ke<br />
sajde me sar jhukaa-diya haatho'n ko tek ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aaya sarhaane tegh bakaf shimr-e roo siyaah<br />
bola gala ke mai hu payambar ki bosagaah<br />
dil ne kaha ke seena hai ganjeena-e ilaah<br />
baitha ye us jaga ke unhe jaaye sharreh aah</p>

<p>is zulm-e- nou se charq-e kohan kaanpne laga<br />
aisa hussain tadpe ke ran kaanpne laga<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dyodi pa aaye sab harame baade shaahe dee'n<br />
boli ye peet peet ke sar zainabe hazee'n<br />
aaya koi yaha'n hai musalmaan ya nahi<br />
baitha hai kis buzurg ke seene pe ye laee'n<br />

<p>aye ibne saad fatima ka kunba rota hai<br />
tu dekhta hai bhai mera zib'ha hota hai<br />
____________________________<br />

<p>paani wo maangte hai pilaata nahi koi<br />
is dard ko qayaal me laata nahi koi<br />
kya qahar hai ke paas bhi aata nahi koi<br />
seene se be hayaa ko uthaata nahi koi</p>

<p>amma tumhaari peet-ti hai bilbilaati hai<br />
wo bete se lipat thi hai hoore'n chudhaati hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>akbar ka sadqa aap mere kaam aaiye<br />
loundi ke baal kholke bewa banaaiye<br />
aaqir huwa suhaag meri nath badhaaiye<br />
bhaabi hassan ko roti thi kyunkar bathaaiye</p>

<p>rand saala mai talab nahi karti janaab se<br />
mahroom to na rakhiye azaa-e sawaab se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zainab ne baal khol ke ran ko qadam badhaaye<br />
saidaaniya bhi sath chali gardane jhukaaye<br />
zainab pukaari haaye mere bhai jaan haaye<br />
bhaiyya pukar lo ye behan kis taraf ko jaaye<br />

<p>bheju kise talaash ko sab mere margaye<br />
aankhe behan ki dhoondti hai tum kidhar gaye<br />
____________________________<br />

<p>har bibi baal khole hue qaak udhati thi<br />
par baanu e hazee'n ko kuch ban naa aati thi<br />
jab sar ke kholne ke liye hath uthaati thi<br />
kuch dil me apne sonch ke wo thair jaati thi<br />

<p>churiyaa'n to phir rahi thi dile paash paash par<br />
ek aah aasmaa'n pe thi ek aah laash par<br />
____________________________<br />

<p>aqir tadap ke hazrate zainab ko di nida<br />
ek din wo tha ke qaab me taale hue risa<br />
jannat se aayi loundi ke ghar ashraffunnisa<br />
sar goondha aur phoolne phalne ki di dua<br />

<p>aashiq jo paaya mujhko shahe mashraqain ka<br />
dikhla diya jamaal jaanabe hussain ka<br />
____________________________<br />

<p>ek din ye hai ke saamne hai lasha e hussain<br />
sar kholne ka waqt hai hangaam shoro shain<br />
mujhko adab hai fatima zehra ka farqe ain<br />
ye kaam hai tumhara ke ho unki noore ain<br />

<p>ye sar wahi hai ab ke mai bandhi me aayi thi<br />
apni rida ali o wali ne udhaayi thi<br />
____________________________<br />

<p>zainab pukaari aao gale se lagaau mai<br />
aao jabee'n pa qaak malu nath badhaaoon mai<br />
maa ne dulhan banaaya tha bewa banaaun mai<br />
maango duaa zameen phate aur samaaoon mai</p>

<p>hai hai bichad ke gor kanaare gaye hussain<br />
jeeti rahi mai rone ko maare gaye hussain<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>